  "description": "A unified server-side movement simulator for SetNet: one system advances the position of everything that moves (players, mobs, NPCs, projectiles) along pathfound routes at a fixed rate — with automatic subscription (create a Mover and it's already ticking). It replicates NOTHING: you read positions and replicate them your own way, and a Started hook fires when a mover gets a new destination so you can send just the point to clients (L2-style, client re-paths locally). Depends on SetNet + SetNet.GeoData + SetNet.PathFinding.",
